zstd_neo is an independent, from-scratch implementation of the Zstandard
compression format in Dart. It is not derived from the reference C source
code, but it follows the public format specification:

  https://github.com/facebook/zstd/blob/dev/doc/zstd_compression_format.md

Third-party material:

1. test/fixtures/*.zst and test/fixtures/*.bin
   Generated with, or copied from, the reference Zstandard project
   (https://github.com/facebook/zstd), Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc.
   and affiliates, licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License:
   https://github.com/facebook/zstd/blob/dev/LICENSE

   The files are used only as interoperability test vectors.

2. benchmark/corpus/silesia/*
   The Silesia compression corpus, by Sebastian Deorowicz:
   http://sun.aei.polsl.pl/~sdeor/corpus/silesia.zip
   The files keep their original provenance and licenses; see
   benchmark/corpus/README.md. This corpus is development-only and is
   excluded from the published package via .pubignore.
